    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summoner Tale is an Action RPG that redefines monster-taming with new, immersive way. Play a young summoner on a perilous journey to uncover hidden truths and restore balance. Befriend and command powerful monsters, harness their unique abilities, and forge unbreakable bonds as you build your ultimate squad. Battle through a world on the brink, where every encounter shapes your destiny!   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Tale of Betrayal and Redemption</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monsters and men, bound by destiny and divided by war. In a world where loyalty is tested and legends are rewritten, one journey will determine the fate of all. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash powerful monsters, each with a unique ability! Monsters are divided into four classes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Companions:</strong> Follow and fight beside you until their energy runs out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Attackers:</strong> Appear briefly to unleash devastating attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Supporters:</strong> Provide instant support with special skills, then vanish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enhancers:</strong> Give you new mobility options and special enhancements to conquer your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081350/extras/a3e17cf6c8fc1651538919fe37596193.poster.avif?t=1751261416\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081350/extras/a3e17cf6c8fc1651538919fe37596193.webm?t=1751261416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081350/extras/a3e17cf6c8fc1651538919fe37596193.mp4?t=1751261416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tame Monsters In Many Ways</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monster taming is more dynamic than ever! Battle fierce challengers, race speedy rivals, gather rare items, or complete unique tasks to recruit new allies.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Level Up &amp; Evolve</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle alongside your monsters, level them up, and unlock their true potential as they evolve into even more powerful forms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081350/extras/c0fc696054e53749edeee25090936114.poster.avif?t=1751261416\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081350/extras/c0fc696054e53749edeee25090936114.webm?t=1751261416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081350/extras/c0fc696054e53749edeee25090936114.mp4?t=1751261416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay updated on Summoner Tale! Fresh content, progress insights, and weekly sneak peeks shared on bsky @negmworld.bsky.social\u202c. Follow along and join the journey! </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summoner Tale is an Action RPG that redefines monster-taming with new, immersive way. Play a young summoner on a perilous journey to uncover hidden truths and restore balance. Befriend and command powerful monsters, harness their unique abilities, and forge unbreakable bonds as you build your ultimate squad. Battle through a world on the brink, where every encounter shapes your destiny!   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Tale of Betrayal and Redemption</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monsters and men, bound by destiny and divided by war. In a world where loyalty is tested and legends are rewritten, one journey will determine the fate of all. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash powerful monsters, each with a unique ability! Monsters are divided into four classes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Companions:</strong> Follow and fight beside you until their energy runs out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Attackers:</strong> Appear briefly to unleash devastating attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Supporters:</strong> Provide instant support with special skills, then vanish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enhancers:</strong> Give you new mobility options and special enhancements to conquer your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081350/extras/a3e17cf6c8fc1651538919fe37596193.poster.avif?t=1751261416\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081350/extras/a3e17cf6c8fc1651538919fe37596193.webm?t=1751261416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081350/extras/a3e17cf6c8fc1651538919fe37596193.mp4?t=1751261416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tame Monsters In Many Ways</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monster taming is more dynamic than ever! Battle fierce challengers, race speedy rivals, gather rare items, or complete unique tasks to recruit new allies.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Level Up &amp; Evolve</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle alongside your monsters, level them up, and unlock their true potential as they evolve into even more powerful forms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081350/extras/c0fc696054e53749edeee25090936114.poster.avif?t=1751261416\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081350/extras/c0fc696054e53749edeee25090936114.webm?t=1751261416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081350/extras/c0fc696054e53749edeee25090936114.mp4?t=1751261416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay updated on Summoner Tale! Fresh content, progress insights, and weekly sneak peeks shared on bsky @negmworld.bsky.social\u202c. Follow along and join the journey! </p>",
